{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26940","headline":"和李绅助教不赴看花 · 姚合","name":"和李绅助教不赴看花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笑辞聘礼深坊住，门馆长闲似退居。\n太学官资清品秩，高人公事说经书。\n年华未是登朝晚，春色何因向酒疎。\n且看牡丹吟丽句，不知此外复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}